  "Quotations, Sent: anything expiring within 3 days? Call the client or press Make a revision with a new date.": "Nukuu za bei, Zilizotumwa: kuna inayoisha ndani ya siku 3? Mpigie mteja au bonyeza Tengeneza toleo jipya lenye tarehe mpya.",
