  "Kilimanjaro Hotels Ltd accepted a quotation two weeks ago and has received only half.": "Kilimanjaro Hotels Ltd walikubali nukuu wiki mbili zilizopita na wamepokea nusu tu.",
  "Open Deliveries → Still to deliver and find the client: you see what is outstanding and whether stock is ready.": "Fungua Uwasilishaji → Bado kupeleka na tafuta mteja: unaona kilichobaki na kama stoku iko tayari.",
  "If stock is ready, ask the warehouse to press Make a delivery note for the rest today.": "Kama stoku iko tayari, waombe ghala wabonyeze Andaa hati ya kupeleka iliyobaki leo.",
  "If stock is not there, open the purchase order from the quotation to see when the supplier expects to deliver, and give the client that date.": "Kama stoku haipo, fungua oda ya ununuzi kutoka kwenye nukuu kuona msambazaji anatarajia kuleta lini, na mpe mteja tarehe hiyo.",
  "Every month: look back and plan": "Kila mwezi: angalia nyuma na upange",
  "Once a month, see how your quotations ended and plan who to visit.": "Mara moja kwa mwezi, ona jinsi nukuu zako zilivyoishia na upange utakaowatembelea.",
  "Open Reports → Quotations for Last month, filter by status, and look at the won and lost ones.": "Fungua Ripoti → Nukuu za bei kwa Mwezi uliopita, chuja kwa hali, na angalia zilizopatikana na zilizopotea.",
