  "Open each of your top clients: important dates such as renewals, recent orders, and balance.": "Fungua kila mmoja wa wateja wako wakuu: tarehe muhimu kama za kuhuisha, oda za karibuni, na salio.",
  "Plan visits for next month to the clients who have not ordered recently.": "Panga ziara za mwezi ujao kwa wateja ambao hawajaagiza hivi karibuni.",
