  "Procurement buys the right goods at the right price and makes sure they arrive on time. The routine follows the orders from request to receipt.": "Manunuzi wananunua bidhaa sahihi kwa bei sahihi na kuhakikisha zinafika kwa wakati. Ratiba inafuata oda kuanzia ombi hadi mapokezi.",
  "Every morning: what to buy, what is late": "Kila asubuhi: nini cha kununua, nini kimechelewa",
  "Look at what is waiting to be ordered and what should have arrived already.": "Angalia kinachosubiri kuagizwa na kilichopaswa kuwa kimefika tayari.",
  "On Home, read supplier deliveries late in red. Call each supplier, get a firm new date and tell sales.": "Kwenye Nyumbani, soma mizigo ya wasambazaji imechelewa kwa rangi nyekundu. Mpigie kila msambazaji, pata tarehe mpya ya uhakika na uwaambie mauzo.",
  "Open Purchasing → Purchase requests: approved requests waiting to be ordered. Press Create draft PO.": "Fungua Ununuzi → Maombi ya ununuzi: maombi yaliyoidhinishwa yanayosubiri kuagizwa. Bonyeza Unda rasimu ya PO.",
  "Open Purchasing → Supplier RFQs: enter replies that came in overnight, then press Compare prices.": "Fungua Ununuzi → RFQ za wasambazaji: ingiza majibu yaliyokuja usiku, kisha bonyeza Linganisha bei.",
  "Open the bell for accepted quotations that need goods ordered.": "Fungua kengele kwa nukuu zilizokubaliwa zinazohitaji bidhaa kuagizwa.",
