  "A supplier is late and the client is waiting": "Msambazaji amechelewa na mteja anasubiri",
  "Coast Hygiene Ltd promised 200 cartons of tissue on Monday for Zanzibar Resorts. It is Wednesday and nothing has come.": "Coast Hygiene Ltd waliahidi katoni 200 za karatasi za chooni Jumatatu kwa ajili ya Zanzibar Resorts. Ni Jumatano na hakuna kilichofika.",
  "Call the supplier and get a firm new date.": "Mpigie msambazaji na upate tarehe mpya ya uhakika.",
  "Tell the salesperson so they can warn the client.": "Mwambie muuzaji ili amtahadharishe mteja.",
  "If the new date is too late, ask another supplier with Purchasing → Supplier RFQs and compare.": "Kama tarehe mpya imechelewa mno, muulize msambazaji mwingine kwa Ununuzi → RFQ za wasambazaji na linganisha.",
  "Next month, Business insights will show the supplier's on-time rate. Use it before the next order.": "Mwezi ujao, Maarifa ya biashara itaonyesha kiwango cha msambazaji cha kuleta kwa wakati. Kitumie kabla ya oda inayofuata.",
  "During the day: orders and confirmations": "Mchana: oda na uthibitisho",
  "Each order is recorded and confirmed the same day. An order sent by phone but not recorded will not be received properly.": "Kila oda inarekodiwa na kuthibitishwa siku hiyohiyo. Oda iliyotumwa kwa simu lakini haikurekodiwa haitapokelewa vizuri.",
  "Create the purchase order, check items, prices and terms, and press Submit purchase order.": "Unda oda ya ununuzi, kagua bidhaa, bei na masharti, na bonyeza Wasilisha oda ya ununuzi.",
  "Share the PDF with the supplier and press I have sent it to the supplier.": "Shiriki PDF na msambazaji na bonyeza Nimemtumia msambazaji.",
  "When the supplier confirms, press Supplier confirmed and enter their confirmation number and the Confirmed delivery date.": "Msambazaji akithibitisha, bonyeza Msambazaji amethibitisha na uingize namba yao ya uthibitisho na Tarehe ya uwasilishaji iliyothibitishwa.",
  "When the supplier's invoice arrives, press Record supplier's invoice on the purchase order.": "Ankara ya msambazaji ikifika, bonyeza Rekodi ankara ya msambazaji kwenye oda ya ununuzi.",
  "For imports, add duty, clearing and freight under Import costs & landed cost as soon as you know them.": "Kwa bidhaa za nje, ongeza ushuru, gharama za kutoa mzigo bandarini na usafirishaji chini ya Gharama za uagizaji na gharama halisi (landed cost) mara unapozijua.",
