  "If your company has it, open Stock → Purchase planning and look for products marked Order now.": "Kama kampuni yako inayo, fungua Stoku → Mipango ya ununuzi na tafuta bidhaa zenye alama Agiza sasa.",
  "Open Purchasing → Order, receipt and bill check: billed more than received, or received but not billed?": "Fungua Ununuzi → Ukaguzi wa oda, mapokezi na ankara: bili zaidi ya kilichopokelewa, au kilichopokelewa bila bili?",
