  "Ask the supplier for a corrected invoice or the missing 10 cartons, and note it on the order.": "Muombe msambazaji ankara iliyorekebishwa au katoni 10 zinazokosekana, na uandike kwenye oda.",
  "Every month: suppliers and prices": "Kila mwezi: wasambazaji na bei",
