  "Ask management for the Supplier delivery on time figures from Business insights, and discuss the late suppliers.": "Waombe uongozi takwimu za Wasambazaji kuleta kwa wakati kutoka Maarifa ya biashara, na mjadili wasambazaji wanaochelewa.",
