  "Warehouse": "Ghala",
  "The warehouse makes the stock figures true. If goods move without being recorded, every report about stock, reorders and profit becomes wrong.": "Ghala ndilo linalofanya takwimu za stoku ziwe za kweli. Bidhaa zikihama bila kurekodiwa, kila ripoti ya stoku, maagizo na faida inakuwa si sahihi.",
