  "During the day: record every movement": "Mchana: rekodi kila mwendo wa stoku",
  "Nothing leaves or enters the store without a record. That is the one rule that keeps stock right.": "Hakuna kinachotoka wala kuingia ghalani bila rekodi. Hiyo ndiyo kanuni moja inayoweka stoku sahihi.",
  "Goods arrive: Receive goods, choose the PO and store, enter the quantities, batch and expiry, and save. Partial deliveries are fine.": "Bidhaa zikifika: Pokea bidhaa, chagua PO na ghala, ingiza viasi, bechi na tarehe ya kuisha, na uhifadhi. Mizigo ya sehemu ni sawa.",
  "Goods leave for a client: the delivery note must be dispatched with Dispatch now before the truck leaves.": "Bidhaa zikitoka kwenda kwa mteja: hati ya uwasilishaji lazima itumwe kwa Tuma sasa kabla gari halijaondoka.",
  "Goods go to another store: + Transfer, then Send now. The other store presses Mark as received when they arrive.": "Bidhaa zikienda ghala lingine: + Uhamisho, kisha Tuma sasa. Ghala lingine linabonyeza Weka kama imepokelewa zikifika.",
  "Goods arrive damaged: on the receipt, set Condition to Damaged / rejected for that line, so it does not go into stock.": "Bidhaa zikifika zimeharibika: kwenye mapokezi, weka Hali kuwa Imeharibika / imekataliwa kwa mstari huo, ili zisiingie kwenye stoku.",
  "Damaged goods found on the shelf: Adjust stock, with the reason.": "Bidhaa zilizoharibika zikionekana rafuni: Rekebisha stoku, pamoja na sababu.",
