  "The driver is waiting and sales says \"just load it, we will do the paper later\".": "Dereva anasubiri na mauzo wanasema \"pakieni tu, karatasi tutafanya baadaye\".",
  "Do not load without a delivery note. Open the accepted quotation and press Create delivery note, or + Delivery note on Deliveries.": "Usipakie bila hati ya uwasilishaji. Fungua nukuu iliyokubaliwa na bonyeza Unda hati ya uwasilishaji, au + Hati ya uwasilishaji kwenye Uwasilishaji.",
  "Choose the store, site, driver and vehicle, check quantities, and press Dispatch now. It takes two minutes.": "Chagua ghala, eneo, dereva na gari, kagua viasi, na bonyeza Tuma sasa. Inachukua dakika mbili.",
  "Press Print delivery note and print it for the truck.": "Bonyeza Chapisha hati ya uwasilishaji na uichapishe kwa ajili ya gari.",
  "Goods sent without a record are the main reason stock counts do not match.": "Bidhaa zinazotumwa bila rekodi ndizo sababu kuu ya hesabu za stoku kutolingana.",
  "End of day: the store and the app agree": "Mwisho wa siku: ghala na programu vinakubaliana",
  "Before closing the store, check that today's movements are all in.": "Kabla ya kufunga ghala, hakikisha mienendo yote ya leo imeingizwa.",
