  "A short weekly check catches problems before the monthly count.": "Ukaguzi mfupi wa kila wiki unanasa matatizo kabla ya hesabu ya mwezi.",
  "Open Stock and look at Reorder at the top. Tell procurement, or press Make a purchase request.": "Fungua Stoku na angalia Agiza tena juu. Waambie manunuzi, au bonyeza Andaa ombi la ununuzi.",
