  "The driver closes the loop: without a recorded delivery, finance cannot invoice and the client can dispute it. The driver screen is simple and works without signal.": "Dereva ndiye anayefunga mzunguko: bila uwasilishaji uliorekodiwa, fedha hawawezi kutoa ankara na mteja anaweza kubishana. Skrini ya dereva ni rahisi na inafanya kazi bila mtandao.",
