  "At each site": "Kwenye kila eneo",
  "Record the delivery while you are still with the receiver. The name, signature, photo and location protect you and the company if anything is disputed later.": "Rekodi uwasilishaji ukiwa bado na mpokeaji. Jina, sahihi, picha na mahali vinakulinda wewe na kampuni kama kutatokea ubishi baadaye.",
  "Press Record delivery.": "Bonyeza Rekodi uwasilishaji.",
  "Type the receiver's name, let them sign on the screen and take a photo of the goods.": "Andika jina la mpokeaji, mwache asaini kwenye skrini na upige picha ya bidhaa.",
